e365.com/owa/calendar/ISERPCallBookingPage@ulcampus.onmicrosoft.com/bookings/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Book a call</a>\n  </div>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "7106305", "elType": "section", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "gap": "no", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "structure": "10"}, "elements": [{"id": "01b1868", "elType": "column", "settings": {"_column_size": 100, "_inline_size": null, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}}, "elements": [{"id": "aea3077", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ise-band\" style=\"padding-block:var(--section-y);\">\n<div class=\"ise-container\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem);align-items:center;\">\n  <p class=\"ise-serif\" style=\"font-size:clamp(1.4rem,2.6vw,2.05rem);color:var(--ul-green-heritage);line-height:1.35;margin:0;\">ISE is a computer science degree where you learn by doing, not in lecture halls, but in studios and inside real companies, shipping real software from first year.</p>\n  <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.25rem;\">\n    <div><div class=\"ise-stat__num\">50%</div><div class=\"ise-stat__label\">in paid residency</div></div>\n    <div><div class=\"ise-stat__num\">4 yrs</div><div class=\"ise-stat__label\">to an MSc</div></div>\n    <div><div class=\"ise-stat__num\">5</div><div class=\"ise-stat__label\">residencies</div></div>\n  </div>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "033e0c7", "elType": "section", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "gap": "no", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLi