"max-width:52ch;margin-bottom:2.25rem;\">\n    <p class=\"ise-eyebrow\">How it works</p>\n    <h2 style=\"max-width:20ch;\">Four years. One master's. Five residencies.</h2>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1.25rem;\"><div class=\"ise-card\"><p class=\"ise-eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;\">Year 1</p><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 .5rem;\">Foundations and Residency 1</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--ink-70);\">Studio-based fundamentals in programming, systems and maths, then your first paid residency in the summer.</p></div><div class=\"ise-card\"><p class=\"ise-eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;\">Year 2</p><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 .5rem;\">Residencies 2 and 3</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--ink-70);\">Human-centric computing and security alongside two more paid residencies inside partner engineering teams.</p></div><div class=\"ise-card\"><p class=\"ise-eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;\">Year 3</p><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 .5rem;\">Specialism and Residency 4</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--ink-70);\">Scaling, reliability and a larger immersive software-project residency. Exit here with a BSc (Hons), or continue.</p></div><div class=\"ise-card\"><p class=\"ise-eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;\">Year 4</p><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 .5rem;\">Integrated MSc</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--ink-70);\">AI and machine learning, advanced modules and a research-project residency, completing the integrated MSc.</p></div></div>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "cd3b898", "elType": "section", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "gap": "no", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "structure": "10"}, "elements": [{"id": "2256e4a", "elType": "column", "settings": {"_column_size": 100, "_inline_size": null, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}}, "elements": [{"id": "1eca8db", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"\" style=\"padding-block:var(--section-y);\"><div class=\"ise-container\"><div style=\"max-width:54ch;margin-bottom:2rem;\"><p class=\"ise-eyebrow\">Student stories</p><h2>In their words</h2></div><div class=\"ise-tcards\"><div class=\"ise-tcard\"><p class=\"ise-tcard__quote\">When I first arrived in Ireland, I couldn't speak English. A few years later, I am graduating with first-class honours through a course that completely changed the direction of my career.</p><div class=\"ise-tcard__who\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/hello-elementor-child/assets/photos/student-desiree.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div><a class=\"ise-tcard__name\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/desirèe-charles-b0a4b316b/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Desiree Charles Dos Santos on LinkedIn\">Desiree Charles Dos Santos<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" style=\"vertical-align:-2px;margin-left:.35rem;fill:currentColor;\"><path d=\"M20.45 20.45h-3.56v-5.57c0-1.33-.03-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.86 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.35V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.47-.9 1.63-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.07 2.07 0 1 1 0-4.14 2.07 2.07 0 0 1 0 4.14zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .78 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.22.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.78 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .78 23.2 0 22.22 0z\"/></svg></a><div class=\"ise-tcard__proj\">MSc, now a Software Engineer at Analog Devices</div></div></div></div><div class=\"ise-tcard\"><p class=\"ise-tcard__quote\">I was the only one in my school year of 300 who went to UL. I feel so proud of the leap I took, and who I've become.</p><div class=\"ise-tcard__who\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/hello-elementor-child/assets/photos/student-josh.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div><a class=\"ise-tcard__name\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/joshsloggett/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Josh Sloggett on LinkedIn\">Josh Sloggett<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" style=\"vertical-align:-2px;margin-left:.35rem;fill:currentColor;\"><path d=\"M20.45 20.45h-3.56v-5.57c0-1.33-.03-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.86 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.35V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.47-.9 1.63-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.07 2.07 0 1 1 0-4.14 2.07 2.07 0 0 1 0 4.14zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .78 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.22.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.78 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .78 23.2 0 22.22 0z\"/></svg></a><div class=\"ise-tcard__proj\">BSc, residencies at AWS, Intercom and Stripe; returning to Stripe</div></div></div></div><div class=\"ise-tcard\"><p class=\"ise-tcard__quote\">I'm adding 'researcher' to the list of things I never thought I'd achieve when I started ISE.</p><div class=\"ise-tcard__who\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/hello-elementor-child/assets/photos/student-justyna.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div><a class=\"ise-tcard__name\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/justyna-przy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Justyna Przyborska on LinkedIn\">Justyna Przyborska<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" style=\"vertical-align:-2px;margin-left:.35rem;fill:currentColor;\"><path d=\"M20.45 20.45h-3.56v-5.57c0-1.33-.03-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.86 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.35V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.47-.9 1.63-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.07 2.07 0 1 1 0-4.14 2.07 2.07 0 0 1 0 4.14zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .78 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.22.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.78 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .78 23.2 0 22.22 0z\"/></svg></a><div class=\"ise-tcard__proj\">Residencies at Stripe, Analog Devices, AWS and Virtu; now at Stripe</div></div></div></div><div class=\"ise-tcard\"><p class=\"ise-tcard__quote\">I completed four residencies at a diverse range of companies, which is my favourite aspect of the course. It helped me develop both as a programmer and a team member.</p><div class=\"ise-tcard__who\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/hello-elementor-child/assets/photos/student-ruairi.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div><a class=\"ise-tcard__name\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/ruairíglackin/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Ruairi Glackin on LinkedIn\">Ruairi Glackin<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" style=\"vertical-align:-2px;margin-left:.35rem;fill:currentColor;\"><path d=\"M20.45 20.45h-3.56v-5.57c0-1.33-.03-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.86 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.35V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.47-.9 1.63-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.07 2.07 0 1 1 0-4.14 2.07 2.07 0 0 1 0 4.14zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .78 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.22.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.78 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .78 23.2 0 22.22 0z\"/></svg></a><div class=\"ise-tcard__proj\">BSc, residencies at Transact, AWS and BD; returning to AWS</div></div></div></div><div class=\"ise-tcard\"><p class=\"ise-tcard__quote\">The programme gave me exactly what I was looking for: the opportunity to learn by building, solve real engineering problems alongside industry, and graduate ready to make an impact from day one.</p><div class=\"ise-tcard__who\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/hello-elementor-child/assets/photos/student-adam.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div><a class=\"ise-tcard__name\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/bxrne/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Adam Byrne on LinkedIn\">Adam Byrne<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" style=\"vertical-align:-2px;margin-left:.35rem;fill:currentColor;\"><path d=\"M20.45 20.45h-3.56v-5.57c0-1.33-.03-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.86 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.35V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.47-.9 1.63-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.07 2.07 0 1 1 0-4.14 2.07 2.07 0 0 1 0 4.14zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .78 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.22.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.78 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .78 23.2 0 22.22 0z\"/></svg></a><div class=\"ise-tcard__proj\">MSc, residencies at Analog Devices, Provizio and Johnson & Johnson</div></div></div></div><div class=\"ise-tcard\"><p class=\"ise-tcard__quote\">We were taught the way students want to be taught: through assignments instead of big exams, with the freedom to build alongside companies and bring what we learned back to class.</p><div class=\"ise-tcard__who\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/hello-elementor-child/assets/photos/student-michelle.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div><a class=\"ise-tcard__name\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/michelle-vaz/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Michelle Vaz on LinkedIn\">Michelle Vaz<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" style=\"vertical-align:-2px;margin-left:.35rem;fill:currentColor;\"><path d=\"M20.45 20.45h-3.56v-5.57c0-1.33-.03-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.86 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.35V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.47-.9 1.63-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.07 2.07 0 1 1 0-4.14 2.07 2.07 0 0 1 0 4.14zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .78 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.22.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.78 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .78 23.2 0 22.22 0z\"/></svg></a><div class=\"ise-tcard__proj\">BSc, residencies at AWS and Fin; returning to AWS</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "bb00941", "elType": "section", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "gap": "no", "padding": {"unit": "px", 